        "description": {
            "value": "<p>Predators have treasured your people for centuries, and you've learned how to use your unique anatomy to slip out of their grasp. Your pliable body, lack of bones, and protective shell make you extremely hard to hold on to. You can attempt a Stealth check to Escape in addition to the existing options (but this action still has the attack trait). You gain a +2 circumstance bonus to your first attempt to Escape each round.</p>\n<p>[[/act escape skill=stealth]]</p>"
